        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Steel or Aluminum Frame Mortise Hookbolt Locksets for Sliding Store Front Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe sliding storefront door mortise hookbolt lockset contains everything you need in one kit. The hookbolt mortise lock body is designed for swing or sliding aluminum framed doors. A huge, five-ply, laminated steel bolt that has concealed hardened steel pin provides maximum security. The kit also includes a brass cylinder, trim ring, face plate, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed, easily reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\",  Length -  6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Width - 5/8\", Throw - 15/16”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis complete mortise deadbolt set with solid brass cylinders is available in <b>Single Cylinder</b> (keyed lock outside with thumbturn inside) or <b>Double Cylinder</b> (keyed lock on both the outside and inside). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PBSC</b> - Brass Single Cylinder Mortise Hookbolt  Set:\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\">Solid Brass Cylinder Lock</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-brass-thumbturn-th1100-bt\">Solid Brass Thumbturn</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a></li> \r\n<li>3/16\" Spacer/Trim Ring</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PBDC</b> - Brass Double Cylinder Mortise Hookbolt Set:\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-mortise-locks-for-storefront-door-th1100-bcx2\">Pair of Solid Brass Cylinder Locks (keyed alike)</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Pair of Cylinder Security Guards</a></li> \r\n<li>3/16\" Spacer/Trim Ring</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for trim. When ordering more than 1 set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sliding Storefront Door Mortise Hookbolt Lockset, Brass Cylinders, TH1102-PB",
